      ],
      "source": "https://www.discoverhongkong.com/eng/place-to-go/travel.guide-aberdeen-harbour.html",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Hung Shing Temple sits in the old fishing village, a landmark travelers can visit.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
