      ],
      "source": "https://www.discoverhongkong.com/eng/place-to-go/travel.guide-aberdeen-harbour.html",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1973, Bruce Lee’s film Enter the Dragon used Aberdeen Harbour for its sea‑journey scenes.",
